<ContentLayout title="Kryos Development — Release Status" description="Kryos is in development and has no public release yet." heading="Kryos is in development." lead="Kryos OS and Veckt are not publicly released. There are no public installers or user documentation yet.">
  <section class="section shell article-content">
    <h2>What is available?</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">There is no public Kryos OS release, installer or supported-hardware list. Veckt is also in development and is not available as a public browser release.</p>
    <h2>Documentation</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">User and developer documentation will be published when there is a release to document. Until then, the website provides a high-level overview of the ecosystem and its development state.</p>
    <h2>Where to go next</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">Explore <a href="/en/ecosystem/os/">Kryos OS</a>, learn about <a href="/en/ecosystem/browser/">Veckt</a>, or check <a href="/en/downloads/">release availability</a>. The downloads page will be updated when an official release is ready.</p>
  </section>
